          "type": "Byte*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Delta Seconds",
          "type": "Float"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "update next tick interval\nthis function should be considered as const (don't modify state of object) if node is not instanced!\nbNotifyTick must be set to true for this function to be called\nCalling INIT_SERVICE_NODE_NOTIFY_FLAGS in the constructor of the service will set this flag automatically"
    },
    {
